        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with unpressurised tubular stack design for central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 47%, total efficiency 80%. Operation as base load engine with low partial load hours.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and working materials for operation.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
